      "mergeID": "6a738ebfb1b940b6c3ecf698",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Both a bug and feature request.\n\nIf a user mutes you or you have a user muted, you cannot easily tell if you or another user has each other muted due to the lack of clear icons.\n\nThis is a major moderation issue within group instances as a lot of groups have rules about muting staff as trolls will mute staff to avoid interactions and moderation requests.\n\nPlease add back icons that show if you or a user has each other muted.",
